<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 474)</h2>
<p><b>Reload a session, and stop being told to.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>New: File ▸ Reload Session from Disk (⌘R)</b> — re-reads the session file, for when someone else has updated it or you want to throw away where you've got to. It asks first, because the second case is destructive.</li>
<li><b>Optimising no longer asks you to reload.</b> New stand-ins take effect on the shot you're looking at, at the frame you're on, the moment they finish.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
